{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "ced869648b545f547514181e23f75d2ddb1b30fd1b96d7497d6d111d77990eff", "ja": "いつも全力、だからこそ……", "zh": "正因总是全力以赴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b35ba4f6f28465d489a29612a9049465314f8f4eeaeeb8036ca199b2640af4d1", "ja": "劇場での定期公演でツアーの告知をするも、\n手応えを感じていない様子のメンバー。普段\nの公演と違う、ツアーだからこその特別感を\nどうアピールすればいいのかと悩み、改めて\n『夜』というテーマを突き詰めようとする。", "zh": "在剧场的定期公演中宣布巡演消息，  \n成员们却似乎没有感受到观众的反响。  \n她们苦恼着该如何宣传巡演特有的、  \n不同于平时公演的特别感，决定重新  \n深入探究“夜”这一主题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "39512e2dfafc28b82a1f520bdfbf7db3c63b5461cd0651ec08ac5d53afcd4f0b", "ja": "（今日は劇場で定期公演。ツアーの告知のチャンスだ。\nメンバーのみんな、よろしくな！）", "zh": "（今天是在剧场的定期公演。正是宣传巡演的机会。大家，拜托了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_05_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "26adfd8421e9d3e8f97f9a928f45f01a4399e6a3fcb4b295932a9c1619aec3f8", "ja": "みんな、来てくれてありがちゅー！\nメッチャ盛り上げてくれて、ダブルありがちゅー！", "zh": "大家，谢谢你们来捧场～！\n气氛还搞得这么嗨，双倍谢谢你们～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_05_1002_audience", "source_sha256": "e04ea4136f0c73ed00036fdc2070b7e9642192290decf568a3ac6c88af6ff86d", "ja": "ワアアアァァ―ッ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_05_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "70ebfe600ad52e9c513416ed189d73c1952a2af76388e5909b281423ea3bfd01", "ja": "ところでみなさん！　もうご存じかもしれませんけど、\n私たち今、ツアーをやっているんです！", "zh": "话说回来，各位！你们可能已经知道了，\n我们现在正在举办巡演呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_05_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "97b499d2a9be65ebf1e6d5c1fab4d65228ea588b1c25d23bc209bb411ace9848", "ja": "次で最後、『FantasticLight』公演といって、\n夜がテーマの公演になる予定なんですよ。", "zh": "下一场就是最后一场，名为“FantasticLight”，预计会是一场以夜晚为主题的公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_05_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "e0acbc611bb81538533b0deb42a4099ffaab5279eba8e2d19c37f5ffdb56c28d", "ja": "夜というとみなさまはどのような想像をなさいますか？\n私はやはり、静けさや穏やかな時間を思います。", "zh": "说到夜晚，大家会联想到什么呢？\n我果然还是会想到宁静与安稳的时光。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_05_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "b8a6152082a8ed98b321149b52b6e81022dc06aa5b0ba83df9c4a589033637e4", "ja": "ひとりひとり、持ってるイメージってあるよね～。\nアタシたちもメンバーごとに違うし。", "zh": "每个人都有自己心目中的印象吧～  \n我们也是，每位成员的印象都不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_05_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "17ed3a4feca121844414e32780d324ed0bef07016fbc5b12699911fa1648665b", "ja": "でも、みんなに楽しんでもらえるようにするから！\nとにかく絶対来てネ！　茜ちゃんと約束だゾ☆", "zh": "不过，我会让大家都玩得开心的！总之，一定要来哦！要和小茜约定好了☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_05_1008_audience", "source_sha256": "aee4488acc40e552c9b7b2ea5094da34060d20c94576ed8d15c696cba0c35d91", "ja": "ワアアァァーッ！　行くよーっ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊——！要上咯——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_05_1009_p", "source_sha256": "443fa40ac124bde2121e702f6150ee3ba7e1960712d10d665b7df78009500a06", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま。\nどうだった？　ツアーの告知、手ごたえはあったか？", "zh": "大家辛苦了。\n感觉怎么样？巡演的预告，反响不错吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_05_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "60ab7123d6ec2b58ed36149ef4e20f9992ff5aafe9ab823a622438403b01a3e3", "ja": "うーん……ぼちぼちってカンジ。", "zh": "嗯……感觉还行吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_05_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "4e2365db884fdd79b84447cace581d1336f722023eaab435a8ed4b5f3da3fc93", "ja": "ん～、話してて改めて思ったんだけど……\nツアーって、いつもの公演と、どう違うのかなって。", "zh": "嗯～，聊着聊着我又想了想……巡演和往常的公演，到底有什么不同呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_05_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d2415a6cb8a834b4e216ddfcba52af6346483f924cfc61957b65d35b9eb6dad8", "ja": "どう、って？　色々と違う点はあると思うけど。", "zh": "怎么说？我觉得还是有很多不同之处的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_05_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "a12182d879b03e6df25852956253b2a13452d92cdca037cf60acac7ff1b13944", "ja": "なんて言うかな～……アタシたち、いつも手を抜いたり\nしてないじゃん？　でもツアーって特別だし。", "zh": "该怎么说呢～……我们平时也从来没有偷懒过吧？不过巡演毕竟很特别。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_05_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "1eac0863ed3ecff97fecefd4950e7a079219b142b49bc48e295a62f5bce3a146", "ja": "あ、それです！　私も、お客さんにどうアピールしたら\nいいかって、ちょっと迷っちゃって。", "zh": "啊，就是这个！我也有点纠结，不知道该怎么向观众展现才好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "80d3b37a043522a7bcfb36a461643a6e28205f53d7b1ec0052de1422d70b4ee3", "ja": "なるほど、どう違いを感じてもらえるかってことか。\nまあ、テーマを突き詰めるのはひとつの方法だよな。", "zh": "原来如此，也就是说，要让客人感受到其中的不同之处啊。嗯，把主题进一步深化，确实也是一种方法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_05_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "6980d08a1ec282ed6a32e3371ab4aca760154f18774f701c9f063e697b38fa18", "ja": "むむむ……やっぱりそうなるか～。\nでも、夜のイメージって難しいんだよニャー。", "zh": "唔唔唔……果然会变成这样啊～。\n不过，夜晚的形象真的很难把握喵～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_05_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "b4c6e0efc6ff872c4e8015921e56edaa30a3f94d6a33cf41a54aa1b16394fe64", "ja": "眠いとか、お腹が空くとか～……？", "zh": "会觉得困，或者肚子饿之类的～……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_05_1018_032emi", "source_sha256": "8c1a72ff8f4ea95b54b99d4cdf4f2ea3b0f4fff7ad4baab8b9783390fd76c65e", "ja": "全員が納得できるような、ひとつの答えというのは、\n確かに難しい気がします。むむむ……？", "zh": "要得出一个能让所有人都认同的答案，确实感觉很难呢。唔唔唔……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_05_1019_012mam", "source_sha256": "fd527679040e3f8b0e7ba522e4e0b0573cd65d8b8963b069231f642133a50e8e", "ja": "むむむ……！", "zh": "唔唔唔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_05_1020_p", "source_sha256": "5f4da2dbc7db81614d542d5b77408328eab1b38c70a4a9dcfcca84e6feadd0be", "ja": "（みんな、眉間にしわを寄せている……。\nまだ時間はあるから、じっくり考えてもらおう）", "zh": "（大家都皱着眉头……时间还够，让他们慢慢考虑吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
